The '''2024–25 Malaysia Super League''' ({{langx|ms|Liga Super Malaysia 2024–25}}) was the 21st season of the [[Malaysia Super League]], the top-tier professional [[association football|football]] league in [[Malaysia]] since its establishment in 2004, and the 43rd season of top-flight Malaysian football overall.

This is the first season to have a two-year schedule, since the [[2007–08 Malaysia Super League|2007–08]].<ref>{{cite web|url=https://makanbola.com/liga-malaysia-dijangka-selari-dengan-kalendar-afc-musim-24-25/ |title=Liga Malaysia Dijangka Selari Dengan Kalendar AFC Musim 24/25 |publisher=Makanbola |website=makanbola.com |date=16 September 2023|access-date=13 December 2023 |first=Azim |last=Noor}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.flashsukan.com.my/perubahan-besar-menanti-liga-malaysia-2024/ |title=Perubahan besar menanti Liga Malaysia 2024 |publisher=Flash Sukan |website=flashsukan.com.my |date=16 September 2023|access-date=13 December 2023 |first=Izzati |last=Rahman}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.flashsukan.com.my/jadual-liga-m-musim-2024-ikut-kalendar-afc/ |title=Jadual Liga M musim 2024 ikut kalendar AFC |publisher=Flash Sukan |website=flashsukan.com.my |date=11 October 2023|access-date=13 December 2023 |first=Firdaus |last=Johari}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.malaysianfootballleague.com/Content/Post/Watch/908 |title=MFL Umum Tarikh Sepak Mula Musim Baharu Liga Malaysia 2024/25 |publisher=Malaysian Football League |website=malaysianfootballleague.com |date=22 December 2023|access-date=22 December 2023}}</ref> This is the first time the league officially applies [[video assistant referee]] (VAR) technology. The defending champion from the [[2023 Malaysia Super League|2023]] season is [[Johor Darul Ta'zim F.C.|Johor Darul Ta'zim]].

On 24 February 2025, Johor Darul Ta'zim were crowned Super League champions for a record 11th time with four matches to spare.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://stadiumastro.com/bola-sepak/terkini-liga-super-jdt-julang-kejuaraan-kali-ke11-berturutturut-283414 |title=TERKINI Liga Super: JDT julang kejuaraan kali ke-11 berturut-turut! |publisher=Stadium Astro |website=stadiumastro.com |date=24 February 2025 |access-date=25 February 2025 |first=Saufi |last=Tahir}}</ref>

